**Interception, measured first.** A plain `GET http://10.38.22.66/` from the unauthenticated
host returns **200 OK** with the DUT's own page carrying
`<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="3;URL=http://10.38.22.66/index.cgi?authenticating=1">`.
That is the web-auth server, not the management HTTP server, which on this unit answers `/` with
